tries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion-1","page_id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion#the-shape","content":"The shape"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion-2","page_id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion#variants","content":"Variants"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion-3","page_id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion#what-a-correct-reader-returns","content":"What a correct reader returns"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion-4","page_id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion#what-it-reproduces","content":"What it reproduces"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion-5","page_id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion#check-it-yourself","content":"Check it yourself"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion-6","page_id":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/corpus/entries/scval-map-keys-collide-on-native-conversion#the-shape","content":"The five keys are u32 1, i32 1, u64 1, the string \"1\" and the symbol 1. Each maps to a different value (10, 20, 30, 40, 50), so a conversion that drops entries is easy to detect."},"1559":{"id":"/docs/corpus/entries/sc